### 7. Common Slice Patterns

#### Data Management Slices
- `fundSlice` - Fund data management
- `portfolioSlice` - Portfolio management
- `transactionSlice` - Transaction history
- `marketDataSlice` - Real-time market data

#### User Management Slices
- `userSlice` - User profile and authentication
- `preferencesSlice` - User preferences
- `kycSlice` - KYC status and documents

#### UI State Slices
- `uiSlice` - UI state management
- `modalSlice` - Modal state management
- `notificationSlice` - Notification management